WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.040
In psychology, the dark triad&nbsp;
represents three personality traits:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:13.600
Narcissism, Psychopathy and Machiavellianism.
 
 
If we were to ask the three, “who has the darkest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.560
personality?” The Narcissist would&nbsp;
say “me”, the Psychopath would say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:23.040
“I don’t care” and the Machiavellian would&nbsp;
say “it’s whoever I want it to be”.
 
 &nbsp;

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:34.240
People scoring high on the 3 traits are more&nbsp;
likely to commit crimes, and create severe social&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:41.200
problems in society, families and organizations.&nbsp;
This is why the research on the dark triad is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:47.920
used widely in law enforcement, psychology, and&nbsp;
business. Here is an overview of what we know.
 
 &nbsp;

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:56.960
The Narcissist displays grandiosity, entitlement,&nbsp;
and superiority and wants nothing more than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:03.120
admiration. Once he gets what he wants, the&nbsp;
narcissist is rarely interested in other people.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.720
When he does care, it’s to enhance his status,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.920
which is why he likes to&nbsp;
mingle with successful others.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:14.880
They seem as though they're completely in&nbsp;
love with themselves, but at the root of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:22.640
their inflated egos are often deeply-held feelings&nbsp;
of inferiority. To protect their constructed self,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:27.520
they can never admit to being wrong, which&nbsp;
is why they lie or blame others.  
 
 &nbsp;

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:36.320
Machiavellians are unprincipled, cold, and&nbsp;
have a cynical view of other human beings.&nbsp;

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.360
They like money, power, and winning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:43.360
and they use manipulation to get&nbsp;
what they want or exploit others.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.920
If manipulation doesn’t work, they steal or&nbsp;
betray. Those high on the spectrum believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.520
it’s better to be feared than being liked and&nbsp;
offend others as a strategy to control them.
 
 &nbsp;

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:02.080
When you are a psychopath, you come&nbsp;
across as cold and others think you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:09.280
are scary. You also show little to no fear,&nbsp;
act impulsively and you enjoy mental thrills.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:14.080
Those high on the spectrum&nbsp;
don’t form any emotional bonds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:19.760
The result is a complete lack of compassion.&nbsp;
That means they have no problem being mean.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:25.680
If something terrible happens, they later&nbsp;
often don’t feel any remorse or guilt. 
 
 &nbsp;

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:33.280
The research tells us that men score significantly&nbsp;
higher on all three compared to women.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:40.320
And while these three personalities are&nbsp;
empirically distinct, they do overlap. Clinically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:46.560
both narcissism and psychopathy are regarded as&nbsp;
mental disorders,while Machiavellianism isn’t.
 
 &nbsp;

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.920
Whether nature or nurture is responsible&nbsp;
for these traits has been somewhat answered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.920 --> 00:03:00.240
by twin studies that show that narcissism and&nbsp;
psychopathy have substantial genetic components.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:07.520
Machiavellianism seems to be less prevalent in&nbsp;
pairs of twins. However, the environment also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:14.400
matters. A psychopath may not only pass down his&nbsp;
genes but influence a child by being a role model.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:21.280
A machiavellian father shares with his son not&nbsp;
only genetic material but might also show him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:27.520
all his tricks. The son of a narcissist, not&nbsp;
only gets his dad’s chromosomes, but maybe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:34.800
also experiences his perfectionism.
 
 
With the big five personality traits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:40.080
also known as OCEAN, the three correlate&nbsp;
either positively or negatively.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:46.320
Narcissists and psychopaths are often&nbsp;
open to new ideas and extroverted.&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.840
Psychopath and Machiavellians&nbsp;
have low conscientiousness&nbsp;

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.720
All three personality types&nbsp;
score low on agreeableness&nbsp;

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:59.840
And Psychopaths are hardly neurotic -&nbsp;
whatever happens, leaves them cold.
 
 &nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.480
An evolutionary explanation for these&nbsp;
traits could be sexual strategy.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.920
Many of us pursue a "slow life"&nbsp;
invest in long-term relationships,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.200
have a few children, and spend time on parenting.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:21.520
Dark triad traits may have survived because&nbsp;
they looked to optimize a "fast life". Their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:28.240
ancestors lived in an unpredictable and dangerous&nbsp;
world. Because of a shorter life, they sought many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:34.720
sexual partners, spent no time on parenting,&nbsp;
and did not invest in human relationships.
 
 &nbsp;

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:41.600
This may also explain why they strive&nbsp;
in competitive environments, such as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:48.880
corporations. Here a machiavellian may use charm&nbsp;
and insults to manipulate others. The narcissist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:55.680
his physical appearance and a psychopath, physical&nbsp;
threats. And since they all lack compassion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.280
they often elbow their way to&nbsp;
the top; which is maybe why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:03.760
all 3 dark traits are well-represented&nbsp;
in upper-level management. 
 
 &nbsp;

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:12.240
But there are also downsides. If your mind&nbsp;
was programmed to be impulsive, aggressive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:19.280
and selfish, you are also more likely to abuse&nbsp;
drugs, feel excluded, suffer from depression,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:26.560
or end up in jail.This is why we may not only find&nbsp;
ways to protect ourselves from these darker minds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:32.240
but also have empathy for them. After all,&nbsp;
maybe they didn’t choose to be that way.
 
 &nbsp;

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:41.040
What about you? Did you inherit some dark triad&nbsp;
traits? And if that’s the case, and if you are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.960
aware of them, did you develop strategies to cope&nbsp;
with them? Share your thoughts in the comments&nbsp;&nbsp;

